--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
russh-sftp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream : https://github.com/AspectUnk/russh-sftp
License  : Apache-2.0

    Copyright the russh-sftp authors and contributors (AspectUnk)

src/server/sftp_loop.rs adapts russh-sftp's server request dispatch and adds
request read-ahead and sequential write coalescing. src/ssh/tokio_client/
sftp_client.rs implements pipelined file transfers on russh-sftp's public
RawSftpSession API. bssh otherwise depends on the unmodified russh-sftp crate.

